   "Management announced a $2bn reduction in 2027 capital spending, lowering the plan from $13.4bn to $11.4bn to reduce near-term high-cost borrowing.",
   "The board has authorized a comprehensive strategic review to evaluate regulatory, financial, and corporate structure alternatives to unlock value and achieve investment-grade credit ratings.",
